      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: Hi, Storm. I'm currently at work, so I can't repro at the moment, but there's a list of non-humanoid avatars that affected this bug before VRChat patched it.\n\nIm pulling the same list from this thread: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/bug-1351-non-rigged-avatars-linger-locally-after-changing-avatars\n\navtr_d641ce94-a8d1-45fa-9902-fec86d9d04e1\n\navtr_5d462aef-0703-4459-aaf2-373881f8a99e\n\navtr_28a8f812-6add-426a-b429-9781605fa1a6\n\navtr_7775d133-9ecf-4835-b8eb-50205508a617\n\navtr_73f9f1a9-3415-4c5d-9ddd-8e5ca0b9cb81\n\navtr_0b64d931-f85b-4104-a1f8-0eff006807df\n\navtr_f21b8d82-18a7-47e6-a778-ef361edcf998\n\navtr_b9f098f5-117e-420f-b77d-7717f60320c4",
