  "details": "Steps for Reproduction:\n\n1. Wear any properly rigged humanoid avatar.\n\n2. Open a mirror, or personal mirror; understand that everything works as intended.\n\n3. Become any non-humanoid rigged or non-rigged avatar, such as a prop, or a still model.\n\n4. Change back to your previous avatar, or to any humanoid rigged avatar.\n\n5. Open the mirror again, and see that animations have stopped.\n\nVideo link embed: https://discord.com/channels/189511567539306508/449386885299830794/1159466856541859920\n\nVideo file: https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/449386885299830794/1159466856034345030/2023-10-05_07-23-33.mp4?ex=653120a8&is=651eaba8&hm=8cbb205cacc78e75bfcfd5a1e04afccc44c3e03a1b09deedaf2d363f057ed576&",
